# Agent / contributor scratch notes (per .junie/AGENTS.md, Checklist-Based State Tracking)
docs/dev/scratch/

# Retired GitHub wiki working clone (separate RTP.wiki.git repo, never part of this repo).
# Its content now lives under docs/ (operator reference in docs/admin/, narrative in docs/site/).
# Kept ignored so a leftover local clone does not get committed.
/wiki/
.junie/memory/tasks.md
.junie/memory/memory.version
.junie/memory/language.json
.junie/memory/feedback.md
.junie/memory/errors.md
# Python bytecode / caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# MkDocs generated static site output (built from docs/ into ./site by `mkdocs build`).
# This is the generated artifact, NOT the tracked narrative source under docs/site/.
/site/
